      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOMBEUR (6) cops his widest draw yet but has been very good despite working in his two starts to date, winning on debut at Cranbourne before a 4.4m fourth at Melton. Showing promise and can win if things go his way. ARZALI ROCKSTAR (4) has been producing some good efforts including a win from wider two back at Geelong and she races well at this circuit and distance with a win and a placing from two attempts. MISTER AMERICANO (5) draws wider but comes back in grade on his resuming fifth at Cranbourne. His best results have come at this shorter distance so he looks an improver. SPRINGFIELD RIVER (3) didn't perform to market expectations when resuming but did have to work. Strikes at 50 per cent at this distance and has won when second-up before so look for improvement.",
